## Mobile build configs

This Tauri mobile app only targets Android users, and the development only runs on macos with M4 chip.
Therefore this project only needs above build targets. 

Platform is only limited to aarch64. Don't consider others like x86_64.

Following are the only places this mobile app need to run:
- Dev. This opens an android emulator with API level 30 and runs mobile dev build. 
- Local e2e tests. This runs wdio tests in a headed android emulator with API level 30. 
- CI tests. This runs wdio tests in a headless android emulator with API level 30. 
- Production release build. This only targets aarch64 Android platform.

In CI (Github Actions) the emulator is already provided, so my build scripts should not worry about managing emulators. 
